{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:56:34.124Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Hei, olen Hieronta Maatti. Millä nimellä kutsumme teidät hierontaan?", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:56:48.496Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Nimeni on testihenkilö ja edustan organisaatiota testi OY.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:56:49.788Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:56:55.026Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Mikä on teille mukava muisto näiltä tai aiemmilta ATK-päiviltä?", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:57:02.984Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Muistan kun ensimmäinen tietokone tuli toimistoon.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:57:04.275Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:57:11.805Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Eli kutsumme teidät nimellä testihenkilö, organisaatiosta testi OY, ja muistonne ATK-päiviltä on: “Muistan kun ensimmäinen tietokone tuli toimistoon.” Onko tämä oikein?", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:57:41.696Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "En valitettavasti kuule sinua.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:57:53.807Z", "source": "user", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kyllä yhteenveto on oikein.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": false, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:57:55.089Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitos. Kirjaan tietoja.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
{"ts": "2026-05-25T14:58:01.837Z", "source": "system", "kind": "utterance", "text": "Kiitoksia. Kutsumme teidät mahdollisimman pian. Kuulemiin.", "call_sid": "CAb39730290a024aefcd00a251ade53270", "stream_sid": "MZ5bcb9b40c7228b3ad1d598d4b8c9a859", "speaking": true, "listening": false}
